# [GP-2] Developer scratch scripts that instantiate live provider SDKs.
# These are the ROOT CAUSE of the LPR-002 Resend key leak: test-resend.js
# carried a live `re_...` key that is still reachable in git history at
# b11f9f5^. The working tree was redacted to REDACTED_USE_RESEND_API_KEY_ENV,
# but redaction is not remediation and these files will simply re-leak the
# next time someone pastes a real key to debug. They are untracked now and
# must stay untracked. If you need to smoke-test a provider, read the key
# from process.env and keep the script out of git.
test-*.js
test-*.mjs
